- The regex patterns themselves are correct in only matching one or two `*`/`_` at the start/end, but the `punctuation` sub-token regex was too permissive. By using `^(\*\*|__)|(\*\*|__)$` for bold and `^([*_])|([*_])$` for italic, we ensure only the correct number of markers are matched as punctuation.
